# INVWINWC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the search dialog's
# Available check box, the results' titles and refusals, the item form's
# Part of and the captions of forms.  Item 1 is installed into item 3.
# Searches: a text; a text with a category filter; a serial number with a
# filter that it ignores; the filters alone; Available alone, which lists the
# top-level items not lent (2 and 3, not the installed 1); nothing given,
# and a status with Available, refused in the dialog; Esc on the results
# shows the dialog with its values and Available kept.  INS on the results
# of a text search with a location filter presets the location, on the
# results of a search for no location none.  The forms: item 1,
# installed, has Part of "3 Hercules Graphics Card" and item 3 none;
# captions of a saved item, a location, a service record, and of new ones.
# The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINWC.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
K ALT-C I
T 3
K ENTER
S INSTLD
K ALT-S T
S DIALOG
T Tandon
K ENTER
S TEXT
K ESC
S TEXTBACK
K ALT-C
T D
K ENTER
S TEXTFLT
K ESC ESC
K ALT-S T ALT-S
T HGC-0042
K ALT-C
T S
K ENTER
S SERIAL
K ESC ESC
K ALT-S F
T CC
K ENTER
S FILTERS
K ESC ESC
# Available alone: DEL clears the category; from the filters dialog it is
# Category, Location, Status, Available
K ALT-S T ALT-V SPACE
S AVAIL
K ENTER
S AVAILRES
K ESC
S AVAILBK
K ESC ESC
# nothing given, and a status with Available
K ALT-S T ENTER
S NOTHING
K ESC ALT-S T ALT-A DOWN ALT-V SPACE ENTER
S BOTH
K ESC ESC
# the location filter presets a new item
K ALT-S T
T Tandon
K ALT-L
T B2
K ENTER
S LOCRES
K INS
S PRESET
K ESC ESC ESC
# Part of
K ENTER
S PART
K ESC DOWN DOWN ENTER
S TOP
K ESC
# captions: item, location, service record, then new ones
K ALT-L B
K CTRL-E
S LOCFORM
K ESC INS
S NEWLOC
K ESC ESC ESC
K HOME ALT-C S
K ENTER
S SERVREC
K ESC INS
S NEWSERV
K ESC ESC ESC
K INS
S NEWITEM
K ESC ESC
# a search for the items of no location, (no location) chosen from the
# location's pick list: none; INS there gives a new item no location
K ALT-S T ALT-L F4 ENTER
S NOLOCQ
K ENTER
S NOLOCRES
K INS
S NOLOCNEW
K ESC ESC ESC
K ALT-F X
